{
	"TanStack Query optimistic rollback (JavaScript)": {
		"prefix": "queryOptimistic",
		"body": [
			"export function ${1:useCreateTodo}() {",
			"  const queryClient = useQueryClient();",
			"  const ${2:todoQueryKey} = ['${3:todos}'];",
			"",
			"  return useMutation({",
			"    mutationFn: ${4:createTodo},",
			"    onMutate: async (input) => {",
			"      await queryClient.cancelQueries({ queryKey: ${2} });",
			"      const previous = queryClient.getQueryData(${2});",
			"      queryClient.setQueryData(${2}, (current) => [",
			"        ...(current ?? []),",
			"        { id: crypto.randomUUID(), title: input.title },",
			"      ]);",
			"      return { previous };",
			"    },",
			"    onError: (_error, _input, context) => {",
			"      if (!context) {",
			"        return;",
			"      }",
			"",
			"      if (context.previous === undefined) {",
			"        queryClient.removeQueries({ queryKey: ${2}, exact: true });",
			"        return;",
			"      }",
			"",
			"      queryClient.setQueryData(${2}, context.previous);",
			"    },",
			"    onSettled: async () => {",
			"      await queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ${2} });",
			"      $0",
			"    },",
			"  });",
			"}"
		],
		"description": "Create an optimistic mutation whose rollback distinguishes a failed preparation from an empty cache. Requires useMutation and useQueryClient from @tanstack/react-query and a secure context for crypto.randomUUID.\n\n创建乐观更新 mutation，其回滚会区分「onMutate 未完成」与「原本无缓存」；需要 @tanstack/react-query 的 useMutation、useQueryClient，以及可用 crypto.randomUUID 的安全上下文。",
		"scope": "javascript,javascriptreact"
	},
